OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry day although the
OL,6,Fodd light shower possible across
OL,7,Fnorthern Argyll. Rather cloudy at
OL,8,Ftimes but some bright or sunny spells
OL,9,Fbreaking through.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,13,Fwith cloud clearing to allow some
OL,14,Flengthy clear periods. Chilly in some
OL,15,Frural glens.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FAll parts will have a dry and
OL,18,Fwarm day with some good spells of
OL,19,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
